'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be bought from the [[Truth Enforcers Premium Warbond|Truth Enforcers]] page of the [[Superstore#Permanent_Catalog|Permanent Catalog]] on the [[Superstore]] for {{Currency|SC|400|notext}} and 200 [[Super Credits]], respectively.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Unflinching}}

==Trivia==
This armor was likely inspired either by the Nazi elite soldiers in ''[https://machinegames.com/games/wolfenstein-the-new-order Wolfenstein: The New Order,]'' or from the counter-terrorism unit in ''[https://fr.futabasha.co.jp/special/kerberos-saga Kerberos Panzer Cop]'' called ''“Kerberos”'' —or, perhaps more fittingly, the “Hellhounds.”

